Attempt: 1
IR Content:
```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: script-engine-injection
  kind: taint
  severity: WARNING
  message: "Detected potential code injection using ScriptEngine. Ensure user-controlled data cannot enter '.eval()', otherwise, this is a code injection vulnerability."
  metadata:
    language: java
    category: security
    cwe: "CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')"
    owasp: "A03:2021 - Injection"
    references:
      - https://find-sec-bugs.github.io/bugs.htm#SCRIPT_ENGINE_INJECTION
      - https://owasp.org/Top10/A03_2021-Injection

sources:
  - id: USER_INPUT
    match:
      node: METHOD_PARAMETER_IN
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: typeFullName
          right: ".*"

sinks:
  - id: SCRIPT_ENGINE_EVAL
    match:
      node: CALL
      api: 
        type: javax.script.ScriptEngine
        method: eval
      arg_index: 0

sanitizers:
  - id: LITERAL_STRING_ARG
    match:
      node: LITERAL
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: value
          right: "^\"[^\"]+\"$"
    effect: neutralize
    scope:
      sinks: [SCRIPT_ENGINE_EVAL]

propagations:
  - id: PARAM_TO_ARG
    edge: arg->param
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "sources节点定义过于宽泛，会导致所有方法参数都被标记为源，与原始规则检测用户可控数据输入的意图不符"
  - "sanitizers节点的LITERAL_STRING_ARG正则表达式不准确，无法正确匹配原始规则中的字符串字面量过滤条件"
  - "propagations节点缺失对字段赋值的传播路径定义，无法覆盖ScriptEngine实例作为字段变量的情况"
```
